gobuster
Usage: gobuster dir -u URL -w WORDLIST [-q] [-x EXTS]

Brute-forces what a web target does not link to: hidden directories and files,
dns subdomains, or virtual hosts. `dir` mode walks a wordlist against a url and
shows the status code of every path that exists.

	dir -u URL -w LIST   directory/file brute force
	dns -d DOMAIN -w LIST   subdomain brute force
	vhost -u URL -w LIST    virtual-host brute force
	-x php,txt,bak        also try these extensions on each word
	-q                    quiet: just the hits, no status lines

Only against a target you own or are authorised to test.

See also: ffuf, httpx, dnsx
